# Don & Raph, Hard Science: a card with an Adventure is a creature card in the hand, but cast as its Adventure it is a
# noncreature spell (CR 715.3a, 601.2a), so it is "the next noncreature spell" and has the affinity. After the attack Bot1 casts
# Bonecrusher Giant's Stomp ({1}{R}, 2 damage to Bot2): with the three Moxen there the {1} comes off and Mox Ruby's {R}
# pays all of it. The affinity is then used up, so Mind Stone ({2}) afterwards costs its full price, paid with the other two Moxen.

